WEBVTT

00:10:29.633 --> 00:10:33.397
by standing strong together.

00:10:33.397 --> 00:10:36.376
And I believe that we can.

00:10:36.376 --> 00:10:38.295
I believe that we can. Thank you guys so much.

00:10:38.295 --> 00:10:40.702
This is a dream come true. Thank you. (Applause)

00:10:40.702 --> 00:10:42.960
Thank you. (Applause)